  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>pentobarbital</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>N05CA01</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, IV dosing <small>(PK_1C)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Ketharanathan N et al. 2023</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>critically ill children with refractory status epilepticus or severe traumatic brain injury (PICU)</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>pentobarbital</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_pentobarbital/Pentobarbital_Ketharanathan2023_base\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL (L/h/70 kg)</td><td>2.78</td><td>L/h/70 kg</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vd (L/70 kg)</td><td>151</td><td>L/70 kg</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr></table><h4>About pentobarbital</h4><p>Pentobarbital is a barbiturate sedative-hypnotic used as a hypnotic and sedative, and to treat status epilepticus. It remains an approved medicine and is also approved for veterinary use, though it is not authorised in the European Union.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q409632\">Wikidata Q409632</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Pentobarbital\">Pentobarbital</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Ketharanathan N et al. (2023). A Population Pharmacokinetic Model of Pentobarbital for Children with Status Epilepticus and Severe Traumatic Brain Injury. <i>Clinical pharmacokinetics 62(7):1011–1022</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s40262-023-01249-z\">10.1007/s40262-023-01249-z</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/37247187\">37247187</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Ketharanathan_2023: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
